Z||000005||fierohoho||12-06-2001||02:33 PM||||My opinion from a Minnesota law standpoint is it was an illegal search.<P>Our search criteria says an area in immediate control of the driver, which in a Fiero is the entire passenger compartment.<P>The trunk is not an area under the drivers immediate control so unless the driver gave a consent to search it will probably get tossed out.<P>I am suprised it made it that far but Tallahassee may have a different standard.<P>My .02<P>------------------<BR>'84 SE 2.5l<BR>'85 Coupe 2.5l now getting a 3800<BR>'86 SE 2.5l<BR>       <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/lightbar.gif"> ||||reg||1
